flowchart LR
    Client[Patient / Frontend] --> API[FastAPI Gateway]
    API --> InputGuard[Input Guardrails]
    InputGuard --> Agent[NaturopathyAgent]
    API --> Database["Patient & Session DB<br/>(Postgres / SQLite)"]
    Agent --> Session["Session Store<br/>(Redis / In-memory)"]

    subgraph LangGraph["LangGraph Pipeline"]
      Qdrant["Hybrid Context Retriever<br/>(Qdrant + Web Search)"] --> Intake[Intake Node]
      Intake --> ModeCheck{Mode?}
      ModeCheck -->|Question Mode| Response[Answer & Short Advice]
      ModeCheck -->|Treatment Mode| RootCause[Root Cause Node]
      RootCause --> Treatment[Treatment Design Node]
      Treatment --> Recommendation[Recommendation Node]
      Recommendation --> Guardrail[Output Guardrails]
      Guardrail --> Response
      Intake -->|Emergency / Pediatric| Guardrail
    end

    Agent --> Qdrant
